+   (set_member_probation · set_probation_milestone · log_supervised_session · void_supervised_session) plus the
+   unchanged set_onboarding_item for manual ticks and the DA's existing direct edits of onboarding_items.
+   Honest by default: an empty gate reads "Gate not configured", never "cleared"; a legacy tick reads "Done — sign-off
+   not recorded"; no start date reads "Probation start not set", never a made-up day count. Status only — no personal
+   paperwork is ever shown or collected here. Custody: no sign / log / void control on the viewer's own record. */
+const PROB_MS = [
+  { kind: "30day", label: "30-day check-in", node: "30" },
